+NEW_TESTS="single_unit_and_quotient_parse explicit_multiplication_parses_in_compound_expressions negative_quantities_parse_including_compound_ones bare_number_and_dimensionless_quotient_parse quotient_of_two_units_parses juxtaposed_product_parses explicit_product_parses parenthesised_denominator_parses integer_power_parses negative_power_parses rational_power_parses power_of_a_quotient_parses leading_reciprocal_parses leading_reciprocal_of_a_parenthesised_unit_parses prefixed_unit_in_a_quotient_scales_the_numerator prefixed_unit_squared_scales_by_the_prefix_squared prefixed_unit_cubed_in_a_denominator_scales_by_the_prefix_cubed prefixed_units_on_both_sides_of_a_quotient binary_prefix_in_a_quotient_parses long_prefix_names_parse_in_every_position dimension_matches_regardless_of_which_units_are_written a_zero_satisfies_any_annotation_but_a_nonzero_mismatch_does_not mismatched_dimension_is_rejected inverted_dimension_is_rejected degree_celsius_parses negative_degree_celsius_parses degree_fahrenheit_parses degree_celsius_with_a_length_annotation_is_rejected products_and_quotients_are_accepted_but_addition_is_not a_difference_of_quantities_is_rejected parenthesised_negative_integer_exponent_parses negative_rational_exponent_parses one_leading_number_is_accepted_but_a_second_one_is_not a_denominator_may_carry_units_but_not_a_number a_unit_expression_without_a_number_is_rejected_by_parse_but_taken_by_unit_from degree_signs_are_accepted_but_an_ordinary_function_call_is_not unit_names_are_accepted_but_a_variable_is_not known_units_compose_but_an_unknown_one_is_rejected a_ratio_exponent_is_accepted_but_a_decimal_one_is_not surrounding_whitespace_is_ignored_but_an_empty_string_is_rejected unit_from_parses_a_single_unit unit_from_parses_a_quotient unit_from_parses_a_power unit_from_parses_a_juxtaposed_product unit_from_rejects_a_literal_carrying_a_number unit_from_rejects_a_mismatched_dimension unit_from_takes_a_leading_reciprocal unit_from_ignores_surrounding_whitespace unit_from_rejects_blank_unknown_and_variable_inputs unit_from_takes_explicit_products_and_parenthesised_denominators unit_from_takes_negative_and_rational_exponents unit_from_takes_long_and_binary_prefixed_names unit_from_uses_user_defined_units malformed_unit_expressions_are_rejected unit_from_rejects_computed_expressions unit_from_rejects_malformed_expressions unit_from_of_a_cancelling_expression_is_dimensionless parentheses_group_a_product_in_the_numerator a_negated_parenthesised_ratio_exponent_parses a_computed_exponent_is_rejected temperature_conversion_functions_are_not_literals unit_from_takes_a_chained_leading_reciprocal a_power_applies_to_a_grouped_compound_expression repeated_leading_signs_are_preserved_on_compound_quantities repeated_signs_resolve_before_a_degree_temperature_converts unit_from_does_not_take_degree_sign_syntax a_zero_denominator_exponent_is_rejected_by_both_builtins binary_prefixes_compose_under_powers_and_denominators unit_from_requires_a_concrete_annotation_like_parse_does value_in_expresses_a_quantity_in_a_compound_unit value_in_scales_by_the_prefix_raised_to_the_power value_in_converts_to_offset_temperature_scales value_in_of_absolute_zero_is_not_zero_on_an_offset_scale value_in_takes_the_same_unit_expressions_as_unit_from value_in_inverts_parse value_in_rejects_mismatched_dimensions_and_bad_targets a_ratio_exponent_needs_its_parentheses user_defined_derived_units_keep_their_scale_in_compound_expressions parse_takes_the_chained_leading_reciprocal_that_unit_from_takes a_number_juxtaposed_with_a_grouped_expression_is_rejected unit_from_reads_back_what_unit_name_prints superscript_exponents_are_accepted_by_both_builtins value_in_rejects_a_mismatched_dimension_even_for_zero value_in_resolves_user_defined_units_from_the_live_context existing_number_spellings_still_work_in_front_of_a_compound_unit unit_from_round_trips_through_unit_name unit_from_takes_a_unit_expression_but_not_a_function_call user_defined_units_work_in_compound_expressions"
